From 50b69bd99c28e5b1285a48045219e25c36a70f22 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: patch <p@p>
Date: Tue, 2 Jun 2026 11:33:41 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] feat: add per-directory User group mapping CSV to auth export

For each LDAP/SAML user directory, export a CSV mapping file alongside
userdirectories.yaml: auth/userdirectory_<name>.csv with three ';'-separated
columns (LDAP group pattern; User groups; User role). User groups are
comma-joined; names resolved (fallback to IDs). UTF-8 no BOM, values quoted
as needed. Empty provision_groups -> header only. CSVs follow the same
quiet-period rule (resourcetype 49) and join the same atomic commit.

stdlib csv only (no new deps). Verified for Zabbix 7.4.5 and Airflow 3.1.2.
